# L §8.3 LOAD-CYCLE `<x> reads itself both earlier and later on <index>` (tally 2.1.6, issue #71): the index,
# months, not the key variable, and the file and line every load refusal names (L §8.3). M0's fixture basic/cycle-both.
# tally 2.1.5's refcore printed `on m` and no place.
=== m.tally
model basic
  tally 2
  on 2026-03-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
  note "T's base for M0's load-code fixtures (invented): it loads clean; each fixture of codes/m0/edits.tsv changes one line"

source card "T's fixture card (invented)"

unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

index qs = [q1, q2]

input amt: money PLN

input day: date

input rate[k in qs]: num

def fee[k in qs]: money PLN
  rule base v card_2026 = round(amt * rate[k], minor(PLN), half-up)
  rule waived beats base v card_2026 = 0 PLN when rate[k] == 0

def total: money PLN = sum(fee[k] for k in qs)

def run[m in months]: num
  rule base = rate[q1]
  rule mid beats base = run[m - 1] + run[m + 1] when pos(m) > 1

place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..

place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..

move pay: transfers
  on day
  leg cash from konto to world amount fee[q1]

ask q: total, bal(konto, 2026-12-31)

version card_2026
  cite card
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  amt = 100.00 PLN "the card"
  day = 2026-02-10 "the card"
  rate[q1] = 0.1 "the card"
  rate[q2] = 0 "the card"
  opening[konto] = 500.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "the card"
=== expect
refused: LOAD-CYCLE run reads itself both earlier and later on months (m.tally:28)
